      "comment": "FAST BOWLER (5) got around the 400m at this track to take a Maiden in a fast 22.70 for a 2.5 lengths success. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. ODDS ASSASSIN (7) finished fifth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his enormous 22.63 win at this track over 400m. Should be in this for a long way. CRYSTAL MAGIC (1) finished eighth on debut then ran a much improved race last start to claim her maiden win by 2.25 lengths (23.05) at this track. Jumps from the same draw this time. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Bold showing expected again. ASTON SICILY (2) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
